  "selection": "Minimum mean inner validation equal-protected-component MSE across three folds and two development seeds, lexical config tie break. Final validation fold chosen by smallest validation row count using input group counts, before any fitting; independent final seeds stop on this grouped holdout. Activity-only B2 selects on endpoint activity MSE, pair-trained methods select on pair MSE.",
  "preprocessing": "All arms use identical training-fitted nonzero node mask and conservative context C1. R0/R1 changes only the relation weight rule. Raw graph directions/degrees and active masks unchanged. Historical public vocabulary remains fixed, with all effective support learned on each training partition.",
  "correction": "PO/PS forward: shared forward-base W2 plus supported residual W0/W1; reverse: shared W5 plus supported W3/W4; unresolved: base; pairing transformations gated by training occurrence. Base receives gradient from every matching-direction backbone edge.",
  "final_pool": "Each outer/deployment final fit uses the predeclared inner training groups and disjoint grouped validation groups; no validation refit. ENsiRNA historical internal test is retired into grouped development. APP/S7 never enter any selection. Deployment train and validation jointly cover all ENsiRNA; fit training excludes saved validation groups.",
  "pair_protocol": "Twelve known sequence components, four outer tests unchanged. Both endpoints and every shared component excluded from train/validation. Activity standardized using weighted training mean/SD (floor .05). Pair loss=lambda times equal-component mean of squared standardized endpoint difference error. No band tuning or label clipping.",
  "failure_policy": "No poor finite seed removed or restarted. On nonfinite training/validation, retain state and failure, output training-fold mean fallback flagged separately. Missing resource access may block an objective without being called complete.",
  "analysis": {
    "seed": 90413,
    "bootstrap_resamples": 10000,
    "ranking": "Exact fractional membership at top-five prediction tie; average label ranks; shared sequence/pool overlap descriptive, no independent-pool p value",
    "interval_scope": "Fixed-ensemble conditional component bootstrap; seed dispersion separately, no claim of new-study generalization"
  },
